********************** QQBAR TEST INPUT: e+e- -> qqbar at MZ, ISR ON ***********
*  CEEX matrix element, ISR on, FSR off, all 5 quark final states
BeginX
********************************************************************************
*indx_____data______ccccccccc0cccc__________General_____ccc0ccccccccc0ccccccccc0
    0           5000      NEVT = number of events, OBSOLETE!!!
* Center-of-mass energy [GeV]
    1      91.1876e0      CMSene =xpar( 1) Average Center of mass energy [GeV]
    2        0.000e0      DelEne =xpar( 2) Beam energy spread [GeV]
*     PrintOut from generator
    5              1      LevPri =xpar( 5)  PrintOut Level 0,1,2
    6              1      Ie1Pri =xpar( 6)  PrintOut Start point
    7              3      Ie2Pri =xpar( 7)  PrintOut End   point
    9          4.0e0      WtMax =xpar( 9)   Maximum weight for rejection
   10              1      0/1 = constant/varying weight events
