*****   ISR ON, FSR OFF (only beam ISR photons, no FSR off quarks)
   20              1      KeyISR=xpar(20)  ISR on
   21              0      KeyFSR=xpar(21)  FSR off
   16           1e-5      vvmin =xpar(16)
   17         0.99e0      vvmax =xpar(17)
