 3024             16 FOAM Number of bins for edge-histogram in cell exploration
 3025             50 FOAM Events per bin during buildup
 3026              1 FOAM OptRej=1 for constant weights
 3027          1.1e0 FOAM Maximum FOAM weight for internal rejection
 3028              2 FOAM Drive
